            <note corresp="#d74-f5" n="5" xml:id="d74-f5-content">
                <p>Telegram 521 from Taipei, February 3, reported that Rankin requested an interview
                    with President Chiang on an urgent basis but learned that Chiang would not be
                    able to see him until the next day. (Department of State, Central Files,
                    293.9322/2–355)</p>
            </note>
